01:05:38.800 --> 01:05:41.220
- Where is Zeta? - She must be asleep.

01:05:41.220 --> 01:05:44.410
Asleep? I'm very tired.

01:05:44.410 --> 01:05:47.640
Maybe the battle was too much effort for me.

01:05:47.640 --> 01:05:49.750
- Good night. - Good night, Dad.

01:09:02.460 --> 01:09:14.300
- Over there! - Help! Cezom!

01:09:14.300 --> 01:09:18.860
- Dad! - What would happen to him?

01:09:18.860 --> 01:09:21.480
- I think it was Solarita. - Are you okay?

01:09:21.480 --> 01:09:23.560
- I think so. - What happened?

01:09:23.560 --> 01:09:27.020
- I don't know. - Was it Solarita?

01:09:27.020 --> 01:09:29.380
- Did you see him? - It was Solarita.

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:02.660
- I'm going to the control room. - No, stay with Liara.

01:10:03.570 --> 01:10:05.160
- Chapman! - Yes?

01:10:08.220 --> 01:10:10.660
- Use that corridor, it's shorter. - Thanks.

01:10:11.240 --> 01:10:13.920
- And be careful. - I'll be fine, I'll be fine.

01:10:14.120 --> 01:10:22.660
- Heron. - Z, are you okay?

01:11:37.840 --> 01:11:40.650
- And Sesson? - He'll be fine. Liara is with him.

01:11:40.730 --> 01:11:43.650
- I'm glad. - He still wants to return to his world.

01:11:43.760 --> 01:11:46.070
- Yes, but... - This is the best opportunity.

01:11:46.270 --> 01:11:49.670
The chaos of the battle will take us as close to his moon as we ever were.

01:11:49.870 --> 01:11:54.070
It will be simple then, maneuver slowly and directly to his planet without risks.

01:11:54.270 --> 01:11:58.250
- Besides, the trip will be short. - We will be within the radar of the moon.

01:11:58.450 --> 01:12:00.000
Yes, but we will not go unnoticed.

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:05.010
As soon as we reach the range of his instruments, my men will take his suit to the surface.

01:12:05.010 --> 01:12:09.120
As soon as they come to investigate, we will put ourselves in his gravity directing his arrival.

01:12:09.120 --> 01:12:16.630
In the meantime, he will enter in his suit, he will close it, so he will not expose himself to our atmosphere and the rest he already knows.

01:12:16.630 --> 01:12:17.680
Where will I see him?

01:12:17.680 --> 01:12:20.460
In the control room, someone is going to go for you.

01:12:30.670 --> 01:12:35.690
- Z, I didn't think you'd come. - Yes, Frank Chapman.

01:12:35.690 --> 01:12:41.870
- You can talk. - About the surprise I received when I thought I was going to die, something happened to me.

01:12:41.870 --> 01:12:45.670
After I screamed, I knew I could talk.

01:12:45.670 --> 01:12:51.280
- Z. - I have many things to tell you, Frank Chapman.

01:12:51.280 --> 01:13:00.000
It's wonderful that you can talk, Z. I also have many things to tell you, even though everything is so terrible.

01:13:02.750 --> 01:13:07.540
You're beautiful, and you have a lovely face.

01:13:07.540 --> 01:13:23.290
It's strange.

01:13:23.290 --> 01:13:30.000
On this planet, at last, I found what I've been looking for all my life, and I owe it to Banu.

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:38.410
Even though my whole being asks me to stay, it's a solemn duty to go.

01:13:38.410 --> 01:13:41.040
You understand, don't you?

01:13:41.040 --> 01:13:48.500
Frank Chapman, I fell in love with you from the first time I saw you.

01:13:48.500 --> 01:13:51.420
And I could never talk about it until now.

01:13:51.420 --> 01:13:57.120
I know my love for you is so strong.

01:13:57.120 --> 01:13:59.920
I know...

01:14:00.030 --> 01:14:02.360
that you will leave despite everything.

01:14:02.360 --> 01:14:04.040
I must leave.

01:14:30.320 --> 01:14:34.390
Well, it was on time, here we go.

01:14:34.390 --> 01:14:39.760
In an hour we will be close enough to find him.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.720
This is the space base 3-8-0 to lunar base. Change.

01:15:02.720 --> 01:15:06.760
The radar has just located a giant asteroid. Identity unknown.

01:15:06.760 --> 01:15:09.350
We can't find its register in the space boxes.

01:15:09.350 --> 01:15:10.500
The ghost!

01:15:10.500 --> 01:15:13.170
Describe the exact position of the asteroid.

01:15:13.170 --> 01:15:15.560
9 degrees north in the constellation.

01:15:15.560 --> 01:15:17.610
And I have an order from Colonel Lantz.

01:15:17.610 --> 01:15:21.510
He will go down to the asteroid and send White to investigate.

01:15:21.510 --> 01:15:29.000
I hope you find happiness among yours.

01:15:30.000 --> 01:15:33.810
You would be my happiness, here or here.

01:15:36.100 --> 01:15:56.830
Frank Chapman, take this memory with you, it will be of good luck, keep it, it will serve you to save your world again, keep it and don't forget my love for you.

01:15:56.830 --> 01:16:00.000
Yes Z, I will always keep it.

01:16:04.000 --> 01:16:08.480
I confirmed it. A ship similar to yours is arriving in this direction.

01:16:08.480 --> 01:16:10.060
I hope they don't crash.

01:16:10.060 --> 01:16:14.080
No, don't worry. The best men are in control of gravity.

01:16:14.080 --> 01:16:19.600
And there is another one who will come to help me connect the oxygen tanks as soon as the ship is placed.

01:16:19.600 --> 01:16:30.000
Thank you, Geron. We have made friends here. Good friends. We would have been friends

01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:37.270
wherever, on your planet or on Earth, I wish you and Aliara happiness.

01:17:28.380 --> 01:17:29.090
of the crime.

01:17:58.600 --> 01:17:59.280
fight the beaker.

01:18:00.280 --> 01:18:01.250
Speak, White.

01:18:01.250 --> 01:18:06.560
Look, Chapman. There are no traces of Makonnen.

01:18:06.560 --> 01:18:08.480
Where is Makonnen?

01:18:08.480 --> 01:18:09.670
He's dead.

01:18:09.670 --> 01:18:24.290
Where are they?

01:18:24.290 --> 01:18:26.550
Where are they?

01:18:26.550 --> 01:18:28.550
Where are the others?

01:18:30.640 --> 01:18:32.630
-Who is it? -Zeta.

01:18:32.630 --> 01:18:35.470
-Who are you talking about? -Cezom.

01:18:35.470 --> 01:18:50.580
-We have to go back to the ship. -We have to go back to the ship.

01:18:50.580 --> 01:18:57.540
-We have to go back to the ship. -It's okay to talk about other people.

01:18:57.540 --> 01:18:59.540
-It's okay to talk about other people.

01:18:59.540 --> 01:19:00.000
-I think he's in this mode.

01:19:00.920 --> 01:19:10.500
- Do you need help? - You know Frank, you're lucky, this planet is errant.

01:19:10.500 --> 01:19:16.060
I could have taken you. I'm glad to find you.

01:19:16.060 --> 01:19:25.250
- Z, where is he? - You need a break, friend.

01:19:30.190 --> 01:19:51.610
Get ready to take off immediately.

01:19:51.610 --> 01:19:57.880
How are you feeling, Chapman?

01:20:00.060 --> 01:20:08.550
I don't know, and I don't understand. It's incredible.

01:20:08.550 --> 01:20:11.460
We'll take you to the lunar base for a thorough examination.

01:20:11.460 --> 01:20:13.170
Are you hurt?

01:20:13.170 --> 01:20:17.700
I don't think so.

01:20:17.700 --> 01:20:22.370
You were without sense for a long time.

01:20:22.370 --> 01:20:25.280
I must have dreamed.

01:20:25.280 --> 01:20:29.090
It's possible. You were delirious from the shock you received when you got off.

01:20:30.000 --> 01:20:35.120
Rey died, but I left Zeta and Heron.

01:20:35.120 --> 01:20:54.480
He had an adorable face.

01:20:54.480 --> 01:20:56.910
The rockets are ready to take off, ready to count.

01:20:56.910 --> 01:20:59.600
The gravity of this planet is very strong.

01:21:00.190 --> 01:21:02.390
We will need all the push to take off.

01:21:02.710 --> 01:21:05.530
Don't worry, we will take off.

01:21:05.850 --> 01:21:06.850
Counting begins.

01:21:07.230 --> 01:21:19.400
Ten, nine, eight, seven, six, five, four, three, two, one, zero.

01:21:30.570 --> 01:21:31.540
Cutting force.

01:21:31.540 --> 01:21:34.640
Reverse.

01:21:34.640 --> 01:21:37.660
Reverse.

01:21:37.660 --> 01:21:46.140
Now I know that they will never believe me.

01:21:46.140 --> 01:21:50.290
Despite this stone that I carry.

01:22:03.360 --> 01:22:06.340
What will the future reveal then?

01:22:06.340 --> 01:22:09.470
If this story is just the beginning,

01:22:09.470 --> 01:22:12.130
it's just the beginning.

01:22:12.130 --> 01:22:14.340
It's just the beginning.

01:22:14.340 --> 01:22:22.880
The beginning.
